error.invalid_cookie:
Invalid cookie: Samsung did not return `_csrf`.

- make sure the browser is signed in to findmymobile.samsung.cn;
- make sure you copied `JSESSIONID` and not another cookie;
- the cookie may have expired - sign in again and copy a fresh one.

error.invalid_callback:
Field ② does not contain a Samsung sign-in callback.

- an `http://…/config/integrations/…` address is Home Assistant itself, not the sign-in link;
- the callback must start with `ms-app://`;
- the sign-in link from field ① must not be pasted here.

Go back to the browser and copy the `ms-app` request address (step 3).
